# Ajani, Caller of the Pride, +1: "Put a +1/+1 counter on up to one target creature." Ajani comes down on turn 1 (loyalty 4) and
# +1s the Memnite: a 2/2 with one counter, and Ajani is at 5. The target must be a creature (CR 115.1): Mox Pearl is refused, the
# Memnite and Isamaru are the positive controls. On turn 3 "up to one" lets Bot1 choose no target (CR 115.1b): Ajani goes to 6 and
# nothing gets a counter. On turn 5 the Isamaru Bot2 controls is chosen: an opponent's creature is a legal target, and gets the
# counter.

